{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Idle Garden</strong> is a relaxing and soothing desktop idle simulation game.<br>While you work, study, or simply space out, a small garden quietly grows at the bottom of your screen.<br>Seeds sprout, leaves stretch, and flowers bloom one after another \u2014 it doesn\u2019t need your constant attention, yet before you know it, your desktop is filled with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/723eb9b399ff81587424bc35b110bb6d.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=68 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/723eb9b399ff81587424bc35b110bb6d.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/bc9c292171ff777dfc41ca1e44841268.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=68 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/bc9c292171ff777dfc41ca1e44841268.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/a065e667a357a6a0399199f21a8daab2.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=68 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/a065e667a357a6a0399199f21a8daab2.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=