t-align: center\">\ud83c\udf3c A wide variety of decorations can be freely placed and combined</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/77d2372580cd30a2a57b69ae2b01a21e.avif?t=1772192395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras_big/77d2372580cd30a2a57b69ae2b01a21e.avif?t=1772192395 width=1560 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Each decoration has its own little personality \u2014 try interacting with them! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/c534612c68e7c54c26f7900a11e1c4f3.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=172 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/c534612c68e7c54c26f7900a11e1c4f3.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/facc238aa30c38b616044ecf055eb5d3.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=108 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/facc238aa30c38b616044ecf055eb5d3.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/6739c2815b8c72ec6452aaa6b863e125.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=123 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/6739c2815b8c72ec6452aaa6b863e125.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/21e94af0212da80e7e6e2ce224bf1066.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=224 height=119 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/21e94af0212da80e7e6e2ce224bf1066.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf3f Automatic growth and harvesting system for a carefree experience <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/b2b69c3c7d8e33dc722ddad77bd83719.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=150 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/b2b69c3c7d8e33dc722ddad77bd83719.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/75bb5544b673a59c09121e54a0c33184.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=218 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/75bb5544b673a59c09121e54a0c33184.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcd6 Each plant has its own encyclopedia page to record every stage of growth <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/fcfb78b94a751c02431263002b1c395a.avif?t=1772192395\" width=1165 height=1153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We\u2019ve also designed <strong>exclusive packaging</strong>\u00a0for every flower seed and decoration\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/773f5826824d13f6248e7a1aefe981c8.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=434 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/773f5826824d13f6248e7a1aefe981c8.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/773f5826824d13f6248e7a1aefe981c8.mp4?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">just like shopping for toys at a boutique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf19 Customize your own hide shortcut key for quick \u201cinvisible\u201d mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/229c5ff6e419588e41e82db93cef76c3.poster.avif?t=1772192395\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/229c5ff6e419588e41e82db93cef76c3.webm?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/extras/229c5ff6e419588e41e82db93cef76c3.mp4?t=1772192395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can choose to do nothing and simply watch it change,<br>or tap and interact to harvest fruits, rearrange layouts, and adjust decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Coming in future updates:</strong><br>As your garden expands, new plant types, weather effects, themes, and special events will gradually be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Main Features</strong><br>\ud83c\udf31 More wondrous plants are on their way!<br>\ud83c\udf38 Even more beautiful decorations will be added!<br>\u2600\ufe0f Diverse growth stages and seasonal changes<br>\ud83c\udfb5 The melody of your garden will become richer \u2014 look forward to new tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you\u2019re busy or resting, <i>Idle Garden</i> keeps growing quietly.<br>It never rushes you, only gently accompanies you\u2014<br>like a small, breathing touch of green, living on your screen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102020?t=1772192395","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102020?t=1772192395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/56540faf67ea06d294d64e24913945ac026b47a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772192395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102020/56540faf67ea06d294d64e24913945ac026b47a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772192395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4142070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Idle Garden</strong> is a relaxing and soothing desktop idle simulation game.<br>While you work, study, or simply space out, a small garden quietly grows at the bottom of your screen.<br>Seeds sprout, leaves stre